 of reflections on my  activity type  video  i'm also going to have one video a week  where i will answer questions from other  participants and so all of this will be  laid out later on so this is kind of  like uh  uh advanced  news release that this is going to start  happening  on the 1st of september and you'll be  hearing more about it  in another video so stay tuned and i  hope as many of you as possible  join us  thanks for listening  bye for now
 

